  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": "N01",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S01",
      "start": 0.49,
      "end": 6.602,
      "text": "早上七点半，桌上有三盒药，一张写了又划掉的单子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N02",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S02",
      "start": 7.99,
      "end": 12.878,
      "text": "哪盒饭前，哪盒饭后，昨天到底吃没吃——"
    },
    {
      "id": "N03",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S04",
      "start": 20.24,
      "end": 25.608,
      "text": "电话那头问一句『今天吃药了吗』，这头常常答不上来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S04",
      "start": 25.828,
      "end": 28.652,
      "text": "妈，今天药吃了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04-D02",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S04",
      "start": 28.872,
      "end": 30.904,
      "text": "……吃了吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N04",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S05",
      "start": 32.24,
      "end": 38.928,
      "text": "不是不上心。是字太小，规矩太多，一天要记好几回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N05",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S06",
      "start": 40.24,
      "end": 45.392,
      "text": "在外的人，能做的也只剩再发一句『记得吃药』。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N06",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S07",
      "start": 49.24,
      "end": 53.408,
      "text": "可这件事，本来不该靠谁替她记着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "N07",
      "type": "narration",
      "shot": "S08",
      "start": 58.24,
      "end": 62.264,
      "text": "她没打开什么 App，只是说了一句话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S08",
      "start": 62.484,
      "end": 66.268,
      "text": "早饭后的那一次，帮我记上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-D01",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "shot": "S09",
      "start": 67.49,
      "end": 70.578,
      "text": "您听听对不对：早饭后那一次。"
    },
